{
  "app": {
    "comment": "Giggle Band is a self-service product: `allowAuthenticatedCreateOwnBand`\nand `CreateBand` already say any signed-in person may create their own band\nand becomes its `BandAdmin`. Until this declaration existed the identity\nlayer contradicted that -- registration was invite-gated, so nobody could\never be the first `authenticated` caller. See\n`docs/phases/phase-99-self-service-registration.md`.",
    "name": "Giggle Band ADL Example",
    "registration": "selfService",
    "startView": "HomeDashboard"
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "Invitation",
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "label": "Accept invitation",
      "name": "AcceptBandInvitation",
      "preconditions": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "update",
          "name": "acceptInvitation",
          "object": "BandInvitation",
          "patch": {
            "RespondedAt": {
              "kind": "runtime",
              "property": "today"
            },
            "Status": {
              "kind": "literal",
              "value": "Accepted"
            }
          },
          "preconditions": [
            "Invitee == RUNTIME.userId",
            "Status == 'Pending'"
          ],
          "recordId": {
            "kind": "input",
            "name": "Invitation"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "create",
          "authority": "command",
          "name": "createMembership",
          "object": "BandMember",
          "preconditions": [],
          "values": {
            "Band": {
              "field": "Band",
              "kind": "stepField",
              "step": "acceptInvitation"
            },
            "JoinedAt": {
              "kind": "runtime",
              "property": "today"
            },
            "Role": {
              "field": "Role",
              "kind": "stepField",
              "step": "acceptInvitation"
            },
            "User": {
              "kind": "runtime",
              "property": "userId"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Revocation is deliberately any-`BandAdmin`, not sender-only: it relies on\n`BandInvitationPolicy.allowBandAdminUpdateInvitations`, the same\nunrestricted admin-management rule that already lets any `BandAdmin`\nupdate or delete a `BandInvitation` regardless of who sent it (see\n`allowBandAdminUpdateInvitations` / `allowBandAdminDeleteInvitations`).\nRestricting it to `Inviter == runtime.userId` would strand a pending\ninvitation the moment its original sender left the band or lost admin\nrights, which is worse product behavior than letting any current admin\nclean it up. `RespondedAt` is left unset because a revoke is not a\nresponse from the invitee (see the `respondedAtRequiredAfterResponse`\nvalidation on `BandInvitation`).",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "Invitation",
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "label": "Revoke invitation",
      "name": "RevokeBandInvitation",
      "preconditions": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "update",
          "name": "revokeInvitation",
          "object": "BandInvitation",
          "patch": {
            "Status": {
              "kind": "literal",
              "value": "Revoked"
            }
          },
          "preconditions": [
            "Status == 'Pending'"
          ],
          "recordId": {
            "kind": "input",
            "name": "Invitation"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "Name",
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "Description",
          "required": false,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "label": "Create band",
      "name": "CreateBand",
      "preconditions": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "create",
          "establishesContext": "Band",
          "name": "createBand",
          "object": "Band",
          "preconditions": [],
          "values": {
            "CreatedBy": {
              "kind": "runtime",
              "property": "userId"
            },
            "Description": {
              "kind": "input",
              "name": "Description"
            },
            "Name": {
              "kind": "input",
              "name": "Name"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "create",
          "authority": "command",
          "name": "createFounderMembership",
          "object": "BandMember",
          "preconditions": [],
          "values": {
            "Band": {
              "kind": "stepMeta",
              "property": "guid",
              "step": "createBand"
            },
            "JoinedAt": {
              "kind": "runtime",
              "property": "today"
            },
            "Role": {
              "kind": "literal",
              "value": "BandAdmin"
            },
            "User": {
              "kind": "runtime",
              "property": "userId"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "Band",
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "itemFields": [
            {
              "name": "Title",
              "required": true,
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Composer",
              "required": false,
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "DurationSeconds",
              "required": false,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "name": "Songs",
          "repeated": true,
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "label": "Import songs",
      "name": "ImportSongs",
      "preconditions": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "create",
          "forEach": "Songs",
          "name": "importSongs",
          "object": "Song",
          "preconditions": [],
          "values": {
            "Band": {
              "kind": "input",
              "name": "Band"
            },
            "Composer": {
              "field": "Composer",
              "kind": "item"
            },
            "DurationSeconds": {
              "field": "DurationSeconds",
              "kind": "item"
            },
            "Title": {
              "field": "Title",
              "kind": "item"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "Band",
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "SetList",
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "itemFields": [
            {
              "name": "Song",
              "required": true,
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Position",
              "required": true,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "name": "Items",
          "repeated": true,
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "label": "Add songs to set list",
      "name": "AddSongsToSetList",
      "preconditions": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "create",
          "forEach": "Items",
          "name": "addSetListItems",
          "object": "SetListItem",
          "preconditions": [],
          "values": {
            "Band": {
              "kind": "input",
              "name": "Band"
            },
            "Position": {
              "field": "Position",
              "kind": "item"
            },
            "SetList": {
              "kind": "input",
              "name": "SetList"
            },
            "Song": {
              "field": "Song",
              "kind": "item"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "inputs": [
        {
          "itemFields": [
            {
              "name": "Item",
              "required": true,
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Position",
              "required": true,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "name": "Items",
          "repeated": true,
          "required": true,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "label": "Reorder set list",
      "name": "ReorderSetList",
      "preconditions": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "update",
          "forEach": "Items",
          "name": "moveSetListItems",
          "object": "SetListItem",
          "patch": {
            "Position": {
              "field": "Position",
              "kind": "item"
            }
          },
          "preconditions": [],
          "recordId": {
            "field": "Item",
            "kind": "item"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "contexts": [
    {
      "name": "User",
      "object": "User"
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        {
          "condition": "Status == 'Pending'",
          "contextField": "Band",
          "name": "pendingBandInvitation",
          "object": "BandInvitation",
          "userField": "Invitee"
        }
      ],
      "membership": {
        "contextField": "Band",
        "object": "BandMember",
        "roleField": "Role",
        "roles": [
          "BandAdmin",
          "BandMember"
        ],
        "userField": "User"
      },
      "name": "Band",
      "object": "Band",
      "selection": {
        "autoSelect": false,
        "mode": "optional",
        "persistence": "local"
      }
    }
  ],
